graph TD
    A[Oxygen Available] --> B[Aerobic Condition Signal]
    C[Glucose or Other<br/>Carbon Source] --> D[Glycolysis Activated]
    
    B --> E{AND: O2 Present +<br/>Carbon Source?}
    D --> E
    
    E -->|Yes| F[Activate Aerobic Respiration]
    E -->|No| G[Anaerobic Pathways]
    
    F --> H[FNR Inactive in O2]
    H --> I[/Derepress Aerobic Genes/]
    I --> J[cyo Operon Cytochrome bo3]
    I --> K[cyd Operon Cytochrome bd]
    I --> L[ndh NADH Dehydrogenase-2]
    
    C --> M[Glycolysis to Pyruvate]
    M --> N(\1)
    N --> O[Pyruvate Dehydrogenase PDH]
    O --> P[Acetyl-CoA + NADH + CO2]
    
    P --> Q[TCA Cycle]
    Q --> R[Citrate Synthase gltA]
    R --> S(\1)
    S --> T[Aconitase acnA/acnB]
    T --> U(\1)
    U --> V[Isocitrate Dehydrogenase icd]
    V --> W[α-Ketoglutarate + NADH + CO2]
    
    W --> X[α-KG Dehydrogenase sucABCD]
    X --> Y[Succinyl-CoA + NADH + CO2]
    Y --> Z(\1)
    Z --> AA[Succinate Dehydrogenase sdhABCD]
    AA --> AB[Fumarate + FADH2]
    
    AB --> AC[Fumarase fumAC]
    AC --> AD(\1)
    AD --> AE[Malate Dehydrogenase mdh]
    AE --> AF[Oxaloacetate + NADH]
    AF --> R
    
    P --> AG[NADH Pool]
    W --> AG
    Y --> AG
    AF --> AG
    
    AB --> AH[FADH2 to Quinone]
    
    AG --> AI{OR: Which NADH<br/>Dehydrogenase?}
    AI -->|High O2| AJ[NDH-I Complex nuoABCDEFGHIJKLMN]
    AI -->|Low O2| AK[NDH-II ndh]
    
    AJ --> AL[Ubiquinone Reduced UQH2]
    AK --> AL
    AH --> AL
    
    AL --> AM[Quinone Pool QH2]
    AM --> AN{OR: Which Terminal<br/>Oxidase?}
    
    AN -->|High O2| AO[Cytochrome bo3 Oxidase cyoABCDE]
    AN -->|Low O2| AP[Cytochrome bd-I Oxidase cydAB]
    AN -->|Very Low O2| AQ[Cytochrome bd-II Oxidase appCB]
    
    B --> AR{Oxygen Concentration?}
    AR -->|High| AO
    AR -->|Low| AP
    AR -->|Very Low| AQ
    
    AO --> AS[4H+ + O2 → 2H2O]
    AP --> AS
    AQ --> AS
    
    AJ --> AT[Protons Pumped to Periplasm]
    AO --> AT
    
    AT --> AU[Proton Motive Force PMF]
    AU --> AV[Electrochemical Gradient]
    
    AV --> AW{AND: PMF +<br/>ATP Synthase?}
    I --> AX[atpIBEFHAGDC Operon]
    AX --> AY[F0F1-ATPase Complex]
    AY --> AW
    
    AW -->|Yes| AZ[ATP Synthase]
    AZ --> BA[ADP + Pi → ATP]
    BA --> BB[~38 ATP per Glucose]
    
    AS --> BC[H2O Product]
    P --> BD[CO2 from PDH]
    W --> BE[CO2 from IDH]
    Y --> BF[CO2 from α-KG DH]
    
    BB --> BG[ATP for Cellular Processes]
    
    B --> BH{OR: Oxygen<br/>Depleted?}
    BH -->|Yes| BI[FNR Activated]
    BI --> BJ[Induce Anaerobic Genes]
    BJ --> BK[Switch to Anaerobic Respiration]
    BH -->|No| F
    
    AR --> BL[ArcAB Two-Component System]
    BL --> BM{High O2?}
    BM -->|Yes| BN[ArcA Unphosphorylated]
    BN --> BO[Aerobic Gene Expression]
    BM -->|No| BP[ArcA-P Active]
    BP --> BQ[/Repress Aerobic Genes/]
    
    BB --> BR{ATP Sufficient?}
    BR -->|Yes| BS[Reduce Respiratory Rate]
    BR -->|No| BT[Increase Carbon Uptake]
    BT --> C
    
    AL --> BU{OR: Alternative<br/>Quinone Oxidation?}
    BU -->|Minor| BV[Quinol Peroxidase qor]
    BV --> BW[H2O2 Production]
    BW --> BX[Catalase katG/katE]
    BX --> BY(\1)
    
    BB --> BZ[High Energy Yield]
    BC --> CA[Water Product]
    BD --> CB[CO2 Released]
    BE --> CB
    BF --> CB
    

